{"id":"niebla","lemma":"niebla","pos":"noun","rank":2948,"glosses":["fog (a thick cloud that forms near the ground)","fog (a state of mind characterized by lethargy and confusion)"],"ipa":"/ˈnjebla/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"nieblas"},"order":2953,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-niebla.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nos perdimos en la niebla.","en":"We got lost in the fog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459845","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Tan solo podía ver niebla.","en":"I could see nothing but fog.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806357","words":[{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},null]},{"text":"Se levantó la niebla.","en":"The fog has lifted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501118","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to lift","l":"levantar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}